spans.s:
ind.
A preposition and particle implying,
1 Superiority in place, rank, or power, (over, upon, against, above);
2 Proximity, (near);
3 Separation, (severally);
4 Wish, desire:
5 Conjunction, particularizing, (to, with respect to.) Thus अभिक्रमितुं to overpower; अभिगन्तुं to approach; अभिख्यातुं to speak to; अभिभव disgrace; अभिलाष desire; अभ्यग्निं on the fire, &c.
E.
अ neg. भा to shine, and कि aff.
